  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Daughters of Charity health programme</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Objective 1:	To enable the poorest individuals who do not have economic access to existing government or private health facilities or services.
Objective 2:	To improve the health status of mothers and children in the local communities.
Objective 3:	To improve the level of awareness and capacity of the communities to promote healthy life both at community and household level.
Objective 4: 	To reduce the spread of HIV/AIDS and provide care and support to AIDS patients and family members in the catchments area of Adi-Haki Clinic.</narrative>
  </description>
